{"id":"G2440","lemma":"ἱμάτιον","transliteration":"himation","sayIt":"himation","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, neuter","gloss":"clothing","meaning":"ἱμάτιον, -ου, τό\n(dim, of εἷμα, a garment), [in LXX chiefly for בֶּגֶד also for שִׂמְלָה, שַׂלְמָה, etc. ;]\na garment, but in usage always (exc. in p1., see infr.) of an outer garment, a mantle, cloak (thrown over the χιτών; see Rutherford, NPhr., 22; DCG, i, 499a): Mat.9:16, 20-21 Mrk.2:21 5:27-28, 30 Jhn.19:2, Act.12:8, al.; opposite to χιτών, Mat.5:40, Luk.6:29, Act.9:39; pl., garments, clothes (i.e. the cloak and the tunic), Mat.17:2 26:65 27:31, 35, Mrk.5:30 15:20, 24, Jhn.19:23-24, Jas.5:2, al\n(AS)","glosses":["garments","cloak","clothes","garment","cloaks","robe"],"count":58,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-5","v":40,"renderings":{"bsb":"cloak","kjv":"thy cloke"}},{"chapterId":"mat-9","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"garment","kjv":"arment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-9","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"cloak"}},{"chapterId":"mat-9","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"cloak","kjv":"garment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-14","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"cloak","kjv":"garment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-17","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"clothes","kjv":"raiment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-21","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"cloaks","kjv":"clothes"}},{"chapterId":"mat-21","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"cloaks","kjv":"garments"}},{"chapterId":"mat-24","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"cloak"}},{"chapterId":"mat-26","v":65,"renderings":{"bsb":"clothes","kjv":"clothes"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"clothes","kjv":"raiment"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"garments","kjv":"garments"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-2","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"garment","kjv":"garment"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-5","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"cloak"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-5","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"garments","kjv":"clothes"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-5","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"garments"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-6","v":56,"renderings":{"bsb":"touched","kjv":"garment"}},{"chapter